<view class="page"><text class="eyebrow">RECYCLE BIN · 30 DAYS</text><text class="display-title">回收站</text><text class="section-note">删除后，对方会立即失去访问权限。记录将在 30 天后永久清理。</text><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="status-banner status-banner--error"><text>{{error}}</text><button bindtap="onShow">重试</button></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="recycle-loading">正在读取最近删除的记录…</view><view wx:elif="{{moments.length}}"><view wx:for="{{moments}}" wx:key="id" class="deleted-card card"><view><text>{{item.title}}</text><text class="label">删除时间 · {{item.deletedAt || '刚刚'}}</text></view><button class="text-button" loading="{{restoringId === item.id}}" disabled="{{restoringId}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="restore">恢复</button></view></view><empty-state wx:else title="这里空空的" description="最近删除的记录会暂时放在这里。"></empty-state></view>
